PRACTICAL – 6
Title:

Security Auditing of Android Application using Drozer

Aim:

To perform security auditing of an Android application using Drozer.

Objectives:
To understand Android application security auditing
To install and configure Drozer
To connect Drozer with Android emulator/device
To identify insecure components and vulnerabilities
To analyze application attack surface
Procedure:
(i) Install Drozer

Open terminal and run:

sudo apt update
sudo apt install drozer -y

Verify installation:

drozer
(ii) Install Drozer Agent on Emulator/Device

Download Drozer Agent APK and install:

adb install drozer-agent.apk

Launch the Drozer Agent application on emulator/device.

Enable:

Embedded Server
(iii) Forward Port using ADB
adb forward tcp:31415 tcp:31415
(iv) Connect Drozer Console
drozer console connect

👉 Successful connection message will appear.

(v) Identify Installed Packages
run app.package.list
(vi) Find Attack Surface
run app.package.attacksurface <package_name>

Example:

run app.package.attacksurface jakhar.aseem.diva
(vii) Analyze Exported Components

Check exported activities:

run app.activity.info -a jakhar.aseem.diva

Check services:

run app.service.info -a jakhar.aseem.diva
(viii) Test Vulnerabilities

Use Drozer modules to:

Access activities
Query content providers
Interact with services
Observation:
Drozer successfully connected to the Android emulator/device
Installed packages and application details were retrieved
Attack surface information was displayed
Exported activities and services were identified
Security weaknesses and exposed components were observed
Result:

Security auditing of the Android application was successfully performed using Drozer. The tool identified exported components, attack surfaces, and potential vulnerabilities within the application.

Viva Questions:
Q: What is Drozer?

👉 Security testing framework for Android applications.

Q: What is attack surface?

👉 Entry points through which an application can be attacked.

Q: Why use ADB port forwarding?

👉 To connect Drozer console with Drozer Agent running on Android device/emulator.

Q: What can Drozer detect?

👉 Exported activities, services, content providers, and vulnerabilities.

Important Commands
adb forward tcp:31415 tcp:31415
drozer console connect
run app.package.list
run app.package.attacksurface jakhar.aseem.diva
